@startuml sequence-cancel-subscription
title Sequence: User Cancels Package Subscription

actor       User         as U
participant "React SPA"  as SPA  #LightBlue
participant "NestJS API"  as API  #LightGreen
participant "JwtAuthGuard" as JWT  #LightYellow
database    "PostgreSQL"  as DB   #LightSalmon

== User views Dashboard ==

U   -> SPA : Navigate to /dashboard
SPA -> API : GET /api/users/me\n[Authorization: Bearer <token>]
API -> JWT : validate token
JWT --> API : user { id, currentCredits, role }
API -> DB  : SELECT user + active userPackages
DB --> API : User + UserPackage[]
API --> SPA : { email, currentCredits, userPackages: [...] }
SPA --> U  : Render "Active Packages" cards\nwith [Cancel Package] button

== User initiates cancellation ==

U   -> SPA : Click "Cancel Package" on <PackageName>
SPA --> U  : Show inline confirm: "Yes / No"
U   -> SPA : Click "Yes"

== Cancellation request ==

SPA -> API : DELETE /api/purchase/:packageId\n[Authorization: Bearer <token>]
API -> JWT : validate token
JWT --> API : user { id }

API -> DB  : SELECT user_packages\nWHERE user_id=? AND package_id=?\nAND status='ACTIVE'
alt No active subscription found
    DB --> API : null
    API --> SPA : 404 Not Found\n"Active subscription not found"
    SPA --> U  : Toast error
else Active subscription exists
    DB --> API : UserPackage { id, status: ACTIVE }
    API -> DB  : UPDATE user_packages\nSET status='CANCELLED'\nWHERE id=?
    DB --> API : Updated row
    API --> SPA : 200 { message: "Successfully cancelled..." }
    SPA -> API : GET /api/users/me  (refresh)
    API -> DB  : SELECT updated user profile
    DB --> API : Updated profile
    API --> SPA : Updated { userPackages: [] }
    SPA --> U  : Toast success\nRemove card from "Active Packages"\nUpdate credits in Navbar
end

@enduml
